    <string name="shizuku_howto">How to start Shizuku without a computer:\n1. Install Shizuku from Google Play.\n2. Settings → About phone → tap “OS version” 7 times to unlock Developer options.\n3. Settings → Additional settings → Developer options: turn on “USB debugging” and “Wireless debugging” (Wi‑Fi must be on).\n4. Open Shizuku → “Pairing”. Then in Wireless debugging choose “Pair device with pairing code” and type the code into the Shizuku notification.\n5. Back in Shizuku, tap “Start”. After a reboot you need to tap Start again.</string>
    <string name="shizuku_xiaomi_note">Xiaomi/HyperOS: also turn on “USB debugging (Security settings)” in Developer options. Without it the phone blocks changing settings and permissions.</string>
